式新视角合成技术，专门用于包含镜面的场景。它把镜中像视作两幅互补视角，估计镜面并映射相机位姿形成虚拟视角，随后通过两个阶段的生成步骤——镜门控注意力和反射注入——在多视角扩散模型中显式利用反射关系，实现反射一致且场景连贯的新视角。","title":"Reflection-aware Generative Novel View Synthesis"},{"associated_observations":1,"id":"evt_92b34a0be6061e61a820efd82cb68ed3258aff13aab1b5a5091c0e4646d1f45b","internal_url":"/posts/20260905-blogs_podcasts-build-a-physical-ai-model-factory-with-nvidia-cosm-0-db4572b71e/","observation_id":"obs_db4572b71eb09cccddf27d76236d4dc5d129d84d0c831a8ecd0d3b1f22ae58fe","published_at":"2026-09-04T16:16:00Z","related_reports":[],"relation":"original","source":"blogs_podcasts","summary":"这条内容介绍如何利用NVIDIA Cosmos 3在Amazon SageMaker HyperPod上构建一条持续的物理AI模型生产流水线，把合成数据生成、感知与策略后训练以及闭环仿真评估统一在同一模型框架中。","title":"Build a Physical AI model factory with NVIDIA Cosmos 3 on SageMaker HyperPod"},{"associated_observations":1,"id":"evt_f3aebbab148c8eaa6a2696234e9af684ad4f8d974aa96e825179340cbc7a32ff","internal_url":"/posts/20260905-blogs_podcasts-customizing-your-knowledge-base-on-amazon-bedrock--0-b9be5c650c/","observation_id":"obs_b9be5c650c491d2390da4ebe44ef271dbd4c09268bc369b5ff9b7f5119975441","published_at":"2026-09-04T16:08:10Z","related_reports":[],"relation":"original","source":"blogs_podcasts","summary":"利用 Amazon Textract 对 PDF、Word、纯文本、HTML、Excel、图片等多种格式的账单进行文本提取与清洗，再配合 Amazon Bedrock 的生成式 AI 能力构建检索增强生成（RAG）方案，实现对账单的自动解析和问答。","title":"Customizing your knowledge base on Amazon Bedrock for large and complex documents using Amazon Textract"},{"associated_observations":1,"id":"evt_898c7c8da637e947e2c458a6970afb8b4c6aeaf3aecdad52b01d25e16ae09d48","internal_url":"/posts/20260904-blogs_podcasts-ai-driven-development-lifecycle-using-amazon-bedro-0-b5dfb93ee9/","observation_id":"obs_b5dfb93ee9936b169e4518f3b211559104467f38c21654f28558b834220067ac","published_at":"2026-09-03T16:16:28Z","related_reports":[],"relation":"original","source":"blogs_podcasts","summary":"这条内容介绍了基于Amazon Bedrock AgentCore的AI驱动开发生命周期实现方案，包含两个参考案例：一个是从SQL schema自动生成ER图的工具，另一个是多代理架构的代码安全分析系统。","title":"A